&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to design, evaluate, and improve models using robust validation strategies, bias/fairness checks, and performance optimization techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in working on applied AI problems across NLP, computer vision, or multimodal systems or any other domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
