&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional collaboration skills to work with product, engineering, and business stakeholders to deliver impactful AI solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate cutting-edge research into practical, scalable solutions that meet real-world business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
