&lt;p&gt;You will own the product roadmap for RMM — CommerceIQ&#39;s AI-powered retail media automation platform. This means defining where the product goes, not just what gets built next. You will shape how AI and agentic systems replace manual workflows for campaign managers at the world&#39;s largest CPG brands, and how that automation scales across an expanding set of retail platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You operate with limited guidance, set your own success metrics, and are accountable for business-level outcomes. The right candidate sees AI not as a feature to add but as the core architecture to build around.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RMM product roadmap — vision, prioritization, and OKRs tied to platform adoption and retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-driven campaign automation — goal-based bidding, budget pacing, placement optimization, and agentic decision loops across major retailers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automation tooling for internal RMM operations — identifying where AI agents can replace manual workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retailer integrations — scoping and delivering new retail API integrations with engineering and GTM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reporting and analytics surfaces for self-serve and managed customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6+ years total&lt;/strong&gt;, 4+ years in PM for SaaS or software platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full product roadmap ownership with business-level accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL and data analysis skills — you define problems with data, not opinions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shipping PRDs and specs that engineering executes without extensive follow-up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with AI/ML products — you understand how models work well enough to write good requirements for them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in ambiguous, fast-moving environments without waiting for a defined playbook&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong plus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retail media or eCommerce advertising experience (Amazon Ads, Walmart Connect, Instacart, Criteo)&lt;/li&gt;
