&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CommerceIQ is building the AI platform that runs commerce for the world&#39;s largest brands. We are not selling AI demos. We are shipping &lt;strong&gt;AI agents&lt;/strong&gt; for content, media, and sales into the workflows of the Fortune 100 every week.&lt;/p&gt;
