&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of web-scraping and its challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Data analysis and SQL skills&lt;/li&gt;
